    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d255-a3">

                <pb facs="0424" n="328" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg328"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure No. 3.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Turner to Mr.
                            Johnson.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Monrovia, Liberia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1871-10-30"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 30,
                        1871</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    dispatch bearing date October the 28th and addressed to “his excellency the
                    United States minister resident,” and conveying information to the effect that
                    on account of the deposal of “President Roye,” “the government of Liberia will
                    be provisionally conducted by a chief executive committee until the arrival at
                    the seat of government of the vice-president of the republic.”</p>
                <p>In reply, permit me to re-assure the government of Liberia that the policy of
                    strict neutrality with reference to any internal disturbances that may now exist
                    within the republic of Liberia will be strictly adhered to by the Government of
                    the United States. Please accept the indebtedness of this legation for manifesto
                    inclosed in your dispatch.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. MILTON TURNER.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
